TI  - Neural systems of positive affect: Relevance to understanding child and adolescent depression?
AU  - Erika E. Forbes
AU  - Ronald E. Dahl
JO  - Development and Psychopathology
PY  - 2005
VL  - 17
IS  - 3
SP  - 827
EP  - 850
DO  - 10.1017/s095457940505039x
